  "backspaceComment": "How many CODE UNITS one Backspace removes. Anything other than 1 is a shape that `caret - 1` breaks: it leaves half a surrogate pair, a bare combining mark, or one flag letter. This is the table `previousGraphemeBoundary` has to reproduce — or, through a native proxy, never has to, because the browser has already done it.",
